# GitHub Pages passthrough. Do not edit; the router source is minds/router.md.
# Serves minds/router.md byte-for-byte at /minds.md. Keeping the source out of
# the repo root stops Jekyll from generating /minds.html, which GitHub Pages
# would serve at /minds instead of redirecting to the /minds/ page.
layout: null
sitemap: false
permalink: /minds.md
---
